@startuml
title OmniDesk Backlog Refinement Workflow

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Raw Backlog Item" as Raw
rectangle "Clarify Description" as Clarify
rectangle "Define Acceptance Criteria" as Criteria
rectangle "Identify Dependencies" as Dependencies
rectangle "Estimate and Prioritize" as Estimate
rectangle "Ready for Sprint" as Ready
rectangle "Defer or Rework" as Defer

Raw --> Clarify
Clarify --> Criteria
Criteria --> Dependencies
Dependencies --> Estimate

Estimate --> Ready : sufficiently refined
Estimate --> Defer : incomplete or lower priority

Defer --> Clarify : refine later

note bottom of Ready
A backlog item is selected for
a sprint only after review.
end note

@enduml